# --- Terraform ---
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars.example
**/crash.log
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
.terraform.lock*

# --- Env / secrets (mantener solo *.example) ---
**/.env
!**/.env.example
**/*.env.local
**/onmind.ini
!**/onmind.ini.example
xusers.txt
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jwk.json

# --- Node / WebApp ---
**/node_modules/
app/dist/
app/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/*.log
.npm/

# --- Bun ---
.bun/

# --- OS / IDE ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Azure / misc ---
.azure/

# Documentación: se admite README.md, HELP.md, DEPLOY.md (en cualquier carpeta) y docs/*.md
*.md
!README.md
!HELP.md
!DEPLOY.md
!docs/*.md
